  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fiscal Sustainability Program for Economic Development III</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de sostenibilidad fiscal para el desarrollo econ&#xf3;mico III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo de desarrollo del programa es restaurar la sostenibilidad fiscal y promover el desarrollo econ&#xf3;mico y mayor crecimiento. Los objetivos espec&#xed;ficos del programa son: (i) fortalecer el sistema tributario y la administraci&#xf3;n; (ii) mejorar el control y la eficiencia del gasto p&#xfa;blico; (iii) mejorar el marco macro fiscal de planeaci&#xf3;n de mediano plazo y; (iv) reducir los riesgos fiscales y aumentar la transparencia de las empresas p&#xfa;blicas.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general development objective of the program is to restore fiscal sustainability and promote higher economic growth. The specific development objectives of the program are: (i) strengthening the tax revenue system and administration; (ii) increasing control and efficiency of public expenditure; (iii) improving macro-fiscal planning and management; and (iv) reducing fiscal risks and increasing transparency of State-Owned Enterprises (SOEs).</narrative>
  </description>
